abstract: >-
  A practitioner-grade, open-source masterclass in enterprise cyber-risk
  governance, risk, and compliance (GRC), aligned to the Four Lines of
  Defense (4LOD) model. Twenty modules covering NIST CSF 2.0, ISO/IEC
  27001, CIS Controls, PCI DSS, HIPAA, SOC 2, DORA, NIS2, SEC cyber
  disclosure, FAIR risk quantification, AI governance (NIST AI RMF,
  ISO/IEC 42001, EU AI Act, OWASP Top 10 for LLMs), Continuous Controls
  Monitoring, ServiceNow IRM architecture, and consulting practice
  building. Companion open-source reference implementation:
  Lumina Cyber Risk Portal.
keywords:
